## Component Hierarchy

### Full Component Tree

```
app/(dashboard)/certificates/page.tsx (Server Component)
│
├─ getServerUserContext() → userContext
├─ requirePermissionForPage(userId, [AppPermission.CertView], locale, context)
├─ getLocale() → locale
├─ getTranslations(locale) → layout labels
│
└─ <CertListContainer
       userContext={userContext}
       locale={locale}
       labels={t.dashboard.certificates.list} />
    │
    ├─ useCertListViewModel() → viewModel
    │   ├─ useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList) → labels
    │   ├─ useUserStore(s => s.hasPermission) → permission checks
    │   ├─ useRouter() → navigation
    │   ├─ useQuery(CertificatesQueryDocument, { variables, fetchPolicy: 'cache-and-network' })
    │   ├─ useQuery(CertificateCountQueryDocument, { variables: filters, fetchPolicy: 'cache-first' })
    │   ├─ useMutation(CertificatesBatchRevokeMutationDocument)
    │   ├─ useMutation(CertificatesBatchReissueMutationDocument)
    │   ├─ useMutation(CertificatesBatchDeleteMutationDocument)
    │   ├─ useMutation(CertificatesBatchRedownloadMutationDocument)
    │   ├─ Zustand: certListStore
    │   │   (searchQuery, filters, page, pageSize,
    │   │    selectedIds, sortModel, dialog state)
    │   └─ Returns flat viewModel object with labels + labelsBySection
    │
    ├─ <RequirePermission permissions={[AppPermission.CertView]} fallback={null}>
    │   └─ <CertListView {...viewModel} />
    │      ├─ createLazyView(mobileImport, desktopImport)
    │      └─ <ResponsiveViewSwitch mobile={...} desktop={...} props={viewModel} />
    │      │
    │      ├─ Shared: DesktopMetricCardGrid / MobileMetricCardGrid
    │      │    ├─ MetricCard (total)
    │      │    ├─ MetricCard (issued)
    │      │    ├─ MetricCard (revoked)
    │      │    ├─ MetricCard (pending)
    │      │    ├─ MetricCard (expired)
    │      │    └─ MetricCard (failed)
    │      │
    │      ├─ Desktop View: <CertListDesktop />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <PageContainer>
    │      │    │   └─ <PageHeader title="Certificates" subtitle={...}>
    │      │    │        ├─ <PrimaryPageAction label="Generate" onClick={onGenerate} />
    │      │    │        └─ <ExportButton onClick={onExport} />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <DesktopMetricCardGrid metrics={metrics} loading={metricsLoading} />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <FilterBar>
    │      │    │    ├─ <SearchField /> (debounced 300ms)
    │      │    │    ├─ <TemplateFilter dropdown />
    │      │    │    ├─ <StatusFilter dropdown />
    │      │    │    ├─ <DateRangePicker />
    │      │    │    ├─ <RecipientSearch />
    │      │    │    ├─ <FilterButton badgeCount={activeFilterCount} />
    │      │    │    └─ <ClearAllButton />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <BatchOperationsBar> (when selectedIds.size > 0)
    │      │    │    ├─ <SelectedCountChip /> (pluralized)
    │      │    │    ├─ <BatchRevokeButton />
    │      │    │    ├─ <BatchReissueButton />
    │      │    │    ├─ <BatchRedownloadButton />
    │      │    │    ├─ <BatchDeleteButton />
    │      │    │    └─ <DeselectAllButton />
    │      │    │
    │      │    └─ <AppDataGrid
    │      │         columns={columnDefs}
    │      │         rows={data.items} (one page — NOT edges)
    │      │         loading={loading}
    │      │         checkboxSelection
    │      │         onRowClick={onRowClick}
    │      │         onSelectionChange={onSelectionChange}
    │      │         paginationOptions={buildServerPaginationOptions(...)}
    │      │         sortingMode="server"
    │      │         onSortChange={onSortChange} />
    │      │         │
    │      │         └─ Column Renderers:
    │      │              ├─ CertificateStatusBadge → <StatusBadge category="certificateStatus" status={row.status} />
    │      │              ├─ DateColumn → locale-formatted date
    │      │              ├─ ActionsColumn → <RowActionMenu />
    │      │              │    ├─ MenuItem: View Details
    │      │              │    ├─ MenuItem: Revoke (if issued/pending + certificates.revoke)
    │      │              │    ├─ MenuItem: Reissue (if revoked/expired + certificates.manage)
    │      │              │    ├─ MenuItem: Download (if issued)
    │      │              │    ├─ MenuItem: Copy Verification Code
    │      │              │    └─ MenuItem: Delete (if failed + certificates.manage)
    │      │              └─ RecipientColumn → name + email popover
    │      │
    │      ├─ Mobile View: <CertListMobile />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <MobilePageContainer>
    │      │    │   └─ <MobilePageHeader title="Certificates" />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <MobileMetricCardGrid> (horizontal scroll)
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <MobileSearchBar /> (sticky top, debounced)
    │      │    ├─ <FilterButton badgeCount={activeFilterCount} /> → <FilterDrawer />
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <MobileCardList>
    │      │    │    └─ <CertificateCardItem> (per certificate)
    │      │    │         ├─ <CertificateStatusBadge />
    │      │    │         ├─ Certificate Number (Typography, bold)
    │      │    │         ├─ Recipient Name (Typography, secondary)
    │      │    │         ├─ Template Name (Typography, caption)
    │      │    │         ├─ Issue Date (Typography, caption)
    │      │    │         └─ <CardActionMenu /> (individual actions via context menu)
    │      │    │
    │      │    ├─ <GenerateFAB /> (if certificates.generate)
    │      │    ├─ Pull-to-refresh on MobileCardList
    │      │    └─ Infinite scroll / LoadMoreButton on MobileCardList
    │      │
    │      ├─ <EmptyState /> (when no certificates match)
    │      │
    │      ├─ <ErrorState /> (when query fails)
    │      │    └─ <RetryButton />
    │      │
    │      ├─ <RevokeDialog
    │      │     open={revokeDialogOpen}
    │      │     selectedIds={selectedIds}
    │      │     onConfirm={onRevokeConfirm}
    │      │     onCancel={onRevokeCancel}
    │      │     labels={labels.revokeDialog} />
    │      │
    │      └─ <ConfirmDialog
    │           open={confirmDialogOpen}
    │           action={pendingAction}
    │           count={selectedIds.size}
    │           onConfirm={onConfirmAction}
    │           onCancel={onCancelAction}
    │           labels={labels.bulkActions} />
```

### Component Interface Contracts

#### CertListContainer

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `userContext` | `ServerUserContext` | Authenticated user context with role and permissions |
| `locale` | `AppLocale` | Locale from server (ar/en) |
| `labels` | `CertificateListLabels` | Translation strings from i18n (passed via ViewModel) |

**Internal state** (Zustand — `certListStore`):
- `searchQuery: string` — current search input (debounced externally)
- `filters: CertificateFilters` — active filter selections (status, template, category, date range, recipient)
- `page: number` — current page (1-based, page-number offset)
- `pageSize: number` — items per page (default 25)
- `selectedIds: Set<string>` — selected certificate IDs for batch actions
- `sortModel: { field: CertificateSortField, order: SortOrder }` — active sort
- `columnVisibility: Record<string, boolean>` — visible/hidden column toggles
- `revokeDialogOpen: boolean` — revoke dialog visibility
- `confirmDialogOpen: boolean` — generic confirm dialog visibility
- `pendingAction: BatchActionType | null` — which batch action is pending confirmation

**Responsibilities**:
- Render `<RequirePermission>` wrapper
- Call `useCertListViewModel()` hook
- Pass viewModel to `<CertListView {...viewModel} />`

#### CertListView (Switcher)

Uses `createLazyView<CertListViewModel>(mobile import, desktop import)` at module top level.
Passes lazy refs to `<ResponsiveViewSwitch mobile={...} desktop={...} props={viewModel} />`.

**Responsibilities**: No data fetching, no business logic. Solely responsible for lazy-loading the appropriate tier view and passing the viewModel through.

#### CertificateListDesktop → CertListDesktop

Desktop view component. Receives the full ViewModel as props (spread).

**Renders**:
- `<PageContainer>` → `<PageHeader>` with title, subtitle, and action buttons (`PrimaryPageAction` for Generate, `ExportButton` for CSV export)
- `<DesktopMetricCardGrid>` with 6 MetricCards: total, issued, revoked, pending, expired, failed
- `<FilterBar>` (inline, not a popover): search field, template dropdown, status dropdown, date range picker, recipient search, clear-all button, active filter count badge on `<FilterButton>`
- `<BatchOperationsBar>` (conditionally rendered when `selectedIds.size > 0`): selected count chip (pluralized), batch revoke, batch reissue, batch re-download (ZIP), batch delete, deselect all
- `<AppDataGrid>` with server-side pagination via `buildServerPaginationOptions(...)`, checkbox selection, sortable columns, row click → navigate to `/certificates/[id]`
- Row action menu per row: View Details, Revoke (if issued/pending + `certificates.revoke`), Reissue (if revoked/expired + `certificates.manage`), Download (if issued), Copy Verification Code, Delete (if failed + `certificates.manage`)
- `<ExportButton>` (preset) — exports filtered list as CSV
- Empty state when no certificates match, error state with retry, loading overlay

**No viewport logic**: Must NOT import `useMediaQuery` or `useViewport` (ESLint enforced).

#### CertificateListMobile → CertListMobile

Mobile view component. Receives the full ViewModel as props (spread).

**Renders**:
- `<MobilePageContainer>` → `<MobilePageHeader>` with title "Certificates"
- `<MobileMetricCardGrid>` with horizontal scroll for 6 metric cards
- `<MobileSearchBar>` (sticky top, debounced 300ms)
- `<FilterButton>` with active count badge → opens `<FilterDrawer>` (status, template, date range, recipient filters)
- `<MobileCardList>` with `<CertificateCardItem>` per certificate:
  - Certificate number (Typography, bold)
  - Recipient name (Typography, secondary)
  - Template name (Typography, caption)
  - Issue date (Typography, caption)
  - `<CertificateStatusBadge>` (StatusBadge with `category="certificateStatus"`)
  - Context menu for individual actions (View, Revoke, Reissue, Download, Copy Code, Delete)
- `<GenerateFAB>` — floating action button (visible when `certificates.generate` permission)
- Pull-to-refresh on the card list
- Infinite scroll or "Load More" button at bottom
- No batch operations on mobile (individual actions via context menu only)

**No viewport logic**: Must NOT import `useMediaQuery` or `useViewport` (ESLint enforced).
**No cross-imports**: Must NOT import from `certList.desktop.tsx` (ESLint enforced).

#### DesktopMetricCardGrid / MobileMetricCardGrid

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `metrics` | `CertificateMetrics` | Counts from CertificateCountQuery |
| `loading` | `boolean` | Skeleton state when loading |
| `labels` | `MetricsLabels` | Metric card title labels (from labelsBySection.metrics) |

**DesktopMetricCardGrid**: Renders in a responsive grid layout (Grid container with Grid items).
**MobileMetricCardGrid**: Renders in a horizontally scrollable row (overflow-x: auto).

Both use `MetricCard` components — never raw `MetricCard` in the view; always use the grid wrappers.

#### FilterBar (Desktop)

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `filters` | `CertificateFilters` | Current filter values |
| `onFilterChange` | `(key: string, value: unknown) => void` | Apply single filter change |
| `onClearAll` | `() => void` | Clear all filters |
| `activeFilterCount` | `number` | Count of active filters (for badge) |
| `templates` | `TemplateSummary[]` | Available templates for dropdown |
| `categories` | `CategorySummary[]` | Available categories for dropdown |
| `labels` | `FilterLabels` | Filter labels (from labelsBySection.filters) |

**Responsibilities**: Renders inline filter row with: search field (debounced 300ms), template filter dropdown, status filter dropdown (pending/issued/revoked/expired/failed), date range picker (issue date), recipient search field, FilterButton with active count badge, Clear All button.

#### FilterDrawer (Mobile)

Same props as FilterBar but rendered as a MUI Drawer (anchored bottom). Triggered by FilterButton tap.

#### BatchOperationsBar

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `selectedCount` | `number` | Number of selected certificates |
| `actionAvailability` | `BatchActionAvailability` | Which actions are enabled (derived from selection statuses + permissions) |
| `onAction` | `(action: BatchActionType) => void` | Action trigger |
| `onDeselectAll` | `() => void` | Deselect all |
| `labels` | `BatchActionLabels` | Action labels (from labelsBySection.bulkActions) |

**Responsibilities**: Sticky toolbar (appears when `selectedIds.size > 0`). Shows selected count chip (pluralized via `bulkActions.selectedCount(count)`). Renders batch action buttons (revoke, reissue, re-download, delete) — each disabled if status validation fails. Deselect All button.

**Mobile exclusion**: `BatchOperationsBar` is NOT rendered on mobile. Mobile uses individual card context menus only.

#### CertificateStatusBadge

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `status` | `CertificateStatus` | Certificate status enum value |
| `label` | `string` | Localized status text from translation |
| `size` | `'small' \| 'medium'` | Badge size (small for table, medium for card) |

**Implementation**: Uses `<StatusBadge category="certificateStatus" status={status} label={label} size={size} />`.
Requires adding `certificateStatus` as a new StatusBadge category (maps certificate statuses to theme colors — see Status Badge Mapping below).
Uses `sx` prop for coloring (no style props per MUI v9 rules).

#### CertificateCardItem (Mobile)

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `certificate` | `Certificate` | Certificate data |
| `statusBadge` | `React.ReactNode` | Pre-rendered CertificateStatusBadge |
| `labels` | `CardLabels` | Card labels (from labelsBySection) |
| `onClick` | `(id: string) => void` | Card click → navigate to detail |
| `onAction` | `(action: string, id: string) => void` | Context menu action |

**Responsibilities**: MUI Card with certificate number, recipient name, template name, issue date, status badge. Context menu for individual actions (View, Revoke, Reissue, Download, Copy Code, Delete).

#### RevokeDialog

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `open` | `boolean` | Dialog visibility |
| `selectedCount` | `number` | Number of certificates being revoked |
| `onConfirm` | `(reason: string) => void` | Submit with reason |
| `onCancel` | `() => void` | Close dialog |
| `labels` | `RevokeDialogLabels` | Dialog labels |

**Responsibilities**: MUI Dialog with required reason text field, inline validation (`reasonRequired` error message), warning text, cancel/confirm buttons.

