## ViewModel Specification

### `useCertListContainerViewModel()` Return Type

The ViewModel hook returns a flat plain object (spread into `<CertListView {...viewModel} />`). All copy is grouped under `labelsBySection` (multi-area labels, Rule 7). The ViewModel MUST NOT contain viewport logic (no `useMediaQuery`, `useViewport`).

#### Data State Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `loading` | `boolean` | Apollo `useQuery` loading for list |
| `error` | `ApolloError \| undefined` | Apollo error for list |
| `certificates` | `CertificateListItem[]` | Current page of certificate rows (from `data.items`, NOT `data.edges`) |
| `metricsData` | `CertificateMetrics \| undefined` | Metrics from separate query |
| `metricsLoading` | `boolean` | Metrics query loading |
| `totalCount` | `number` | Total certificate count (from `pageInfo.total`, for pagination) |
| `pageInfo` | `PageInfo \| undefined` | Page metadata for AppDataGrid |
| `templates` | `TemplateSummary[]` | Available templates for filter dropdown |
| `categories` | `CategorySummary[]` | Available categories for filter dropdown |

#### Pagination State (from store)

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `page` | `number` | Current page (1-based) |
| `pageSize` | `number` | Items per page (10/25/50) |
| `paginationOptions` | `ListPaginationOptions` | Pre-built `buildServerPaginationOptions(...)` for AppDataGrid |

#### Sort State (from store)

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `sortBy` | `CertificateSortField` | Active sort column |
| `sortOrder` | `SortOrder` | Sort direction |
| `onSortChange` | `(field: CertificateSortField, order: SortOrder) => void` | Sort change handler |

#### Filter State (from store)

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `searchQuery` | `string` | Raw search input |
| `debouncedSearch` | `string` | Debounced search (300ms) |
| `statusFilter` | `CertificateStatus \| null` | Status dropdown value |
| `templateFilter` | `string \| null` | Template UUID |
| `categoryFilter` | `string \| null` | Category UUID |
| `studentName` | `string` | Recipient search text (Plan 02: `studentName`) |
| `issuedAtFrom` | `string \| null` | Issue date range start (Plan 02: `issuedAtFrom`) |
| `issuedAtTo` | `string \| null` | Issue date range end (Plan 02: `issuedAtTo`) |
| `activeFilterCount` | `number` | Count of active non-default filters (for badge) |
| `onSearchChange` | `(query: string) => void` | Search input handler |
| `onFilterChange` | `(key: string, value: unknown) => void` | Generic filter setter |
| `onClearAllFilters` | `() => void` | Clear all filters |

#### Selection State (from store)

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `selectedIds` | `Set<string>` | Selected certificate IDs |
| `selectedCount` | `number` | `selectedIds.size` |
| `onToggleSelection` | `(id: string) => void` | Toggle one ID |
| `onSetSelection` | `(ids: Set<string>) => void` | Replace selection |
| `onClearSelection` | `() => void` | Clear all |

#### Batch Action State & Handlers

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `batchActionAvailability` | `BatchActionAvailability` | Which batch actions are enabled (derived from selection statuses + permissions) |
| `batchActionLoading` | `boolean` | Processing batch mutation |
| `onBatchAction` | `(action: BatchActionType) => void` | Trigger batch action |
| `onBatchRevoke` | `() => void` | Open revoke dialog with selected IDs |
| `onBatchReissue` | `() => void` | Confirm + execute batch reissue |
| `onBatchRedownload` | `() => void` | Trigger ZIP download |
| `onBatchDelete` | `() => void` | Confirm + execute batch delete |

#### Row Action Handlers

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `onRowClick` | `(id: string) => void` | Navigate to `/certificates/[id]` (Plan 18) |
| `onRevoke` | `(id: string) => void` | Open revoke dialog for single certificate |
| `onReissue` | `(id: string) => void` | Reissue single certificate |
| `onDownload` | `(id: string) => void` | Download single certificate PDF |
| `onCopyCode` | `(code: string) => void` | Copy verification code to clipboard |
| `onDelete` | `(id: string) => void` | Delete single failed certificate |

#### Export Handler

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `onExport` | `() => void` | Export filtered list as CSV |

#### Navigation Handler

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `onGenerate` | `() => void` | Navigate to generation dialog (Plan 17) |

#### Permission Flags

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `canView` | `boolean` | `certificates.view` — always true (Container gate) |
| `canManage` | `boolean` | `certificates.manage` — edit, delete, reissue |
| `canGenerate` | `boolean` | `certificates.generate` — generate button |
| `canRevoke` | `boolean` | `certificates.revoke` — revoke action |

#### Labels (Rule 7 — labelsBySection)

| Section | Keys |
|---------|------|
| `labelsBySection.shell` | `pageTitle`, `pageSubtitle`, `generateButton`, `exportButton` |
| `labelsBySection.columns` | `certificateNumber`, `studentName`, `templateName`, `issuedAt`, `expiryDate`, `status`, `verificationCode`, `download`, `view`, `sort` labels |
| `labelsBySection.filters` | `search`, `searchPlaceholder`, `template`, `templatePlaceholder`, `status`, `statusPlaceholder`, `dateRange`, `issuedAtFrom`, `issuedAtTo`, `studentName`, `studentNamePlaceholder`, `clearAll`, `activeCount(count)`, `apply` |
| `labelsBySection.bulkActions` | `revoke`, `reissue`, `redownload`, `delete`, `export`, `selectedCount(count)`, `deselectAll`, `confirmRevoke`, `confirmReissue`, `confirmDelete`, `confirmRedownload`, `confirmRevokeTitle`, `confirmReissueTitle`, `confirmDeleteTitle`, `confirmRedownloadTitle` |
| `labelsBySection.dialogs` | `revokeReason`, `revokeReasonPlaceholder`, `cancel`, `confirm`, `warning` |
| `labelsBySection.actions` | `view`, `revoke`, `reissue`, `download`, `redownload`, `copyCode`, `delete`, `export` |
| `labelsBySection.notifications` | `revokeSuccess`, `revokeFailed`, `reissueSuccess`, `reissueFailed`, `deleteSuccess`, `deleteFailed`, `redownloadSuccess`, `redownloadFailed`, `exportSuccess`, `exportFailed`, `copySuccess` |
| `labelsBySection.states` | `loading`, `error`, `errorRetry`, `empty`, `emptyFiltered`, `noResults` |
| `labelsBySection.metrics` | `total`, `issued`, `revoked`, `pending`, `expired`, `failed` |

