## Desktop View Specification

### `CertListDesktop` — Full Layout

**Renders** (top-to-bottom):

1. **`<PageContainer>`** — standard Siraj page wrapper
2. **`<PageHeader>`** — title (`labelsBySection.shell.pageTitle`), subtitle (`labelsBySection.shell.pageSubtitle`), action buttons:
   - `<PrimaryPageAction>` — "Generate" button (visible when `canGenerate`, navigates to Plan 17 generation dialog)
   - `<ExportButton>` — "Export CSV" button (exports filtered list)
3. **`<DesktopMetricCardGrid>`** — 6 metric cards in a Grid layout:
   - Total certificates (`metrics.total`)
   - Issued (`metrics.issued`)
   - Pending (`metrics.pending`)
   - Expired (`metrics.expired`)
   - Revoked (`metrics.revoked`)
   - Failed (`metrics.failed`)
   - Each shows `MetricCard` with icon, count, and label from `labelsBySection.metrics`
   - Loading skeleton when `metricsLoading`
4. **`<FilterBar>`** — inline filter row (not a popover):
   - Search field (debounced 300ms, matches certificateNumber, studentName, verificationCode)
   - Template filter dropdown (populated from `templates`)
   - Status filter dropdown (pending, issued, revoked, expired, failed)
   - Date range picker (issue date from/to)
   - Student name search field
   - `<FilterButton>` with active filter count badge (`activeFilterCount`)
   - Clear All button
5. **`<BatchOperationsBar>`** — conditionally rendered when `selectedIds.size > 0`:
   - Selected count chip (pluralized via `selectedCount(count)`)
   - Batch Revoke button (disabled if no selected IDs have status `issued` or `pending`, or if `!canRevoke`)
   - Batch Reissue button (disabled if no selected IDs have status `revoked` or `expired`, or if `!canManage`)
   - Batch Re-download button (disabled if no selected IDs have status `issued`)
   - Batch Delete button (disabled if no selected IDs have status `failed`, or if `!canManage`)
   - Deselect All button
   - Processing overlay when `batchActionLoading`
6. **`<AppDataGrid>`** — main data grid:
   - `rows={certificates}` (one page of items, NOT `data.edges`)
   - `paginationOptions={paginationOptions}` (server mode: `page`, `pageSize`, `totalCount`, `onPageChange`)
   - Checkbox selection column (left)
   - Row click → `onRowClick(id)` → navigate to `/certificates/[id]`
   - Sorting via column headers → `onSortChange(field, order)`
   - Columns (with renderers):
     - `certificateNumber` — string, bold
     - `studentName` — string
     - `templateName` — string
     - `issuedAt` — formatted date
     - `expiryDate` — formatted date (or "—" if none)
     - `status` — `<CertificateStatusBadge>` (small size)
     - `verificationCode` — string with copy button
     - Row actions: View, Revoke, Reissue, Download, Copy Code, Delete (context menu)
   - Empty state: `<EmptyState>` with `labelsBySection.states.empty` when no certificates at all
   - Filtered empty: `<EmptyState>` with `labelsBySection.states.emptyFiltered` when filters produce no results
   - Error state: `<ErrorState>` with retry button when `error`
   - Loading overlay when `loading`
7. **`<RevokeDialog>`** — rendered at the Container level (shared between desktop/mobile), open state managed by ViewModel
8. **`<BatchResultDialog>`** — rendered at Container level, shows per-item failures after batch actions

### Desktop Column Definitions

| Column | Render | Sortable | Width | Permission Gate |
|--------|--------|----------|-------|-----------------|
| `certificateNumber` | Bold Typography | Yes | medium | `canView` |
| `studentName` | Typography | Yes | medium | `canView` |
| `templateName` | Typography | Yes | medium | `canView` |
| `issuedAt` | Date-formatted Typography | Yes | narrow | `canView` |
| `expiryDate` | Date-formatted Typography | Yes | narrow | `canView` |
| `status` | CertificateStatusBadge (small) | Yes | narrow | `canView` |
| `verificationCode` | Typography + copy icon | No | medium | `canView` |
| Row Actions | Context menu | No | narrow | Per-action permission |

