## Sidebar Navigation Integration

### Sidebar Entry

The sidebar navigation (managed by the dashboard layout) adds a "Certificates" item:

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| **Label key** | `sidebar.certificates` (translation: "Certificates" / "الشهادات") |
| **Route** | `/certificates` |
| **Icon** | `workspacePremiumOutlined` (MUI icon — uses `Outlined` suffix per MUI v9 naming) |
| **Permission gate** | `certificates.view` — only visible to roles with this permission |
| **Nav group** | Content group (alongside students, courses, etc.) |
| **Order** | After existing content items (students, classes) — before settings |

### Mobile Bottom Navigation

**Decision**: For mobile bottom nav, "Certificates" is shown only for admin and teacher roles (who have `certificates.view` + `certificates.manage`). Student and parent bottom nav may omit certificates if the bottom nav item count exceeds the maximum (typically 5 items).

**Rationale**: Bottom navigation has limited space. Admins and teachers are the primary certificate managers. Students and parents view certificates less frequently and can access via the sidebar (hamburger menu).

