## Error Handling Strategy

### Error Categories and Response

| Error Category | Source | UI State | Retry Behavior |
|----------------|--------|----------|----------------|
| List query failure | Apollo `networkError` or `graphQLErrors` | ErrorState with retry button | Retry button calls `refetch()` |
| Metrics query failure | Apollo error on metrics query | MetricCardGrid shows error placeholder | Automatic retry on next filter change |
| Single revoke failure | Apollo mutation error | Error toast with translated message | User can retry from row action menu |
| Bulk action failure (partial) | `BatchResult.failures[]` | Results dialog with per-item errors | User can retry failed items individually |
| Invalid status transition | GraphQL error `INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION` | Error toast: `invalidStatusTransition` | User action blocked, list refetches |
| Permission denied | GraphQL error `FORBIDDEN` | Error toast: `noPermission` | Bulk action button becomes disabled |
| Network timeout | Apollo `networkError` | ErrorState with retry | Retry button refetches |
| PDF not found on download | GraphQL error `PDF_NOT_FOUND` | Error toast: `pdfMissing` | User notified, list refetches |

### Apollo Error Handling in Container

The container processes Apollo errors from `useQuery` and `useMutation`:

1. **Query errors**: `error.networkError` → network error state; `error.graphQLErrors` → iterate, extract error codes, display translated messages
2. **Mutation errors**: `onError` callback → snackbar with translated error message; cache is NOT rolled back automatically (Apollo handles optimistic rollback)
3. **Batch mutation results**: `BatchResult.failures` array → `<BatchResultDialog>` showing per-item error messages with retry buttons. Failures with code `PDF_NOT_FOUND` display `errors.pdfMissing` message per item.

### Error State Components

| Component | When Used | Behavior |
|-----------|-----------|----------|
| `ErrorState` (full-page) | List query fails | Shows error title + description + retry button. Replaces the data grid entirely |
| `ErrorToast` / Snackbar | Mutation fails | Auto-dismissing toast (4 seconds) with translated error message. Does not block UI |
| `BatchResultDialog` | Bulk action completes with partial failures | Shows success count + failure list with per-item error messages. User can retry individual failures |

