## i18n Design

### Namespace Structure

```
shared/locale/
├── types/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── list.ts          ← CertificateListLabels interface
├── namespaces/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── list.namespace.ts ← defineNamespace registration
├── ar/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── list.ts          ← Arabic implementation
└── en/
    └── dashboard/
        └── certificates/
            └── list.ts          ← English implementation
```

### Registration Points (6 files to create/edit)

1. **Create** `shared/locale/types/dashboard/certificates/list.ts` — `CertificateListLabels` interface with all key groups from requirements.md §3.2–3.12: `pageTitle`, `pageSubtitle`, `searchPlaceholder`, `noCertificatesFound`, `emptyFilteredMessage`, `showingOf`, `selectedCount`, `metrics.*`, `status.*`, `table.*`, `filters.*`, `bulkActions.*`, `revokeDialog.*`, `columnConfig.*`, `actions.*`, `errors.*` (including `pdfMissing`), `messages.*`
2. **Create** `shared/locale/ar/dashboard/certificates/list.ts` — Arabic implementation with pluralization for `selectedCount` and `bulkActions.confirmCount` (zero/one/two/few/many/other rules per §3.11)
3. **Create** `shared/locale/en/dashboard/certificates/list.ts` — English implementation with pluralization (one/other rules)
4. **Create** `shared/locale/namespaces/dashboard/certificates/list.namespace.ts` — `defineNamespace("dashboard.certificates.list", { load: { en, ar } })`
5. **Edit** `shared/locale/namespaces/translation.ts` — Add `Dashboard: { ...existing, CertificateList: DashboardCertificateList }` to the `Translation` registry
6. **Edit** `shared/locale/types/message.ts` — Add a flat `certificateList: CertificateListLabels` entry to the `DashboardTranslations` interface

### Client-Side Usage (in Container and View components)

```
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).pageTitle
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).status.issued
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).table.studentName
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).filters.title
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).bulkActions.revoke
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).revokeDialog.title
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).selectedCount(count)
useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificateList).showingOf(shown, total)
```

