| `actions.copyVerificationCode` | string | "Copy Verification Code" | "复制验证码" |
| `errors.loadFailed` | string | "Failed to load certificates" | "加载证书失败" |
| `errors.revokeFailed` | string | "Failed to revoke certificate" | "撤销证书失败" |
| `errors.invalidStatusTransition` | string | "Invalid status transition" | "无效的状态转换" |
| `errors.reissueFailed` | string | "Failed to reissue certificate" | "重新发布证书失败" |
| `errors.deleteFailed` | string | "Failed to delete certificate" | "删除证书失败" |
| `errors.redownloadFailed` | string | "Failed to re-download certificates" | "重新下载证书失败" |
| `errors.exportFailed` | string | "Failed to export certificates" | "导出证书失败" |
| `errors.pdfMissing` | string | "Certificate PDF not found or not generated" | "证书 PDF 未找到或未生成" |
| `errors.noPermission` | string | "You do not have permission to perform this action" | "您没有权限执行此操作" |
| `messages.revokeSuccess` | string | "Certificate(s) revoked successfully" | "证书撤销成功" |
| `messages.reissueSuccess` | string | "Certificate(s) reissued successfully" | "证书重新发布成功" |
| `messages.deleteSuccess` | string | "Certificate(s) deleted successfully" | "证书删除成功" |
| `messages.redownloadSuccess` | string | "Certificate(s) download started" | "证书下载已开始" |
| `messages.exportSuccess` | string | "Export started" | "导出已开始" |

### Pluralization Implementation

The `selectedCount` and `bulkActions.confirmCount` keys are `(count: number) => string` functions:

**Arabic rules** (per `shared/locale/` convention):
- `count === 0` → zero form
- `count === 1` → one form
- `count === 2` → two form
- `count >= 3 && count <= 10` → few form
- `count >= 11 && count <= 99` → many form
- `count >= 100` → other form

**English rules**:
- `count === 1` → one form ("1 certificate")
- All other → other form ("{count} certificates")

### Interpolation Usage

- `showingOf(shown: number, total: number)` — table footer count display
- `selectedCount(count: number)` — bulk action bar selected count (pluralized)
- `bulkActions.confirmCount(count: number)` — confirm dialog count text (pluralized)

