### Handoff to Plan 18 (Certificate Detail)

Plan 18 (Certificate Detail & Download) consumes:
- Navigation route `/certificates/[id]` from this plan's row click action
- The certificate `id` passed as a URL parameter
- The Apollo cache entry from this plan's list query (Plan 18 can read cached certificate data from the list query if the detail query uses the same `id`-based cache normalization)
- The status badge component and status label translations (Plan 18 reuses the same `StatusBadge` component and `status.*` translation keys)

### Handoff to Plan 17 (Generation Dialog)

Plan 17 (Certificate Generation Dialog) is invoked from a "Generate" button on the certificate list page or from the template management page. The generation dialog may be triggered from the certificate list toolbar (requires `certificates.generate` permission). The generated certificates will appear in the list after the mutation completes and the list query refetches.


